      "content": "thanks, that sounds a lot more soothing than just water. i actually have some of that rosewater in a spray bottle, so i'll just give my eye a few good mists of that with my eyes closed, that should be enough to neutralize the peppermint, right? it seems way more effective at calming the skin than just plain tap water which is so harsh.",
